<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Material Symbols, Rounded style, filled (Apache-2.0, info/LICENSE-material-symbols.txt). The pause menu
    draws few icons and they are solid white glyphs with soft corners (the blip and phone icons); the rounded filled
    set is the closest open match. The game's own icons are Rockstar's artwork and are not bundled. art/icons.py
    fetches every source and moves the paths from 0,-960 onto a 0..960 grid.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role), plus the dropdown, submenu and check indicators and the
    game page icons, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. IconMainMenu is this theme's own mark: a
    five-point star after the HUD's wanted level stars, drawn from ten computed points, not taken from any game file.

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) keep Playnite's own icofont glyphs: Playnite rebuilds them from the TextBlock's
    glyph and font, and their TextBrush foreground already follows the palette.
-->
